{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34463","headline":"送羊振文先辈往桂阳归觐 · 陆龟蒙","name":"送羊振文先辈往桂阳归觐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风雅先生去一麾，过庭才子趣归期。\n让王门外开帆叶，义帝城中望戟支。\n郢路渐寒飘雪远，湘波初暖涨云迟。\n灵均精魄如能问，又得千年贾傅词。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34463.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34463","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}